Advanced Program in Visual Effects

The Advanced Program in Visual Effects is an industry-aligned professional course designed to prepare students for careers in film, OTT content, advertising, and immersive media. The program covers the complete VFX production pipeline — from visual design fundamentals to advanced 3D creation, procedural effects, and final compositing. Students work on hands-on projects while building professional portfolios and demo reels, alongside career readiness and freelancing guidance. By completion, learners are capable of independently producing complete VFX shots from concept to final output, making them job-ready for studios, post-production houses, and freelance roles.

